id: 35
hanzi: 铺
pinyin: pū
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to spread; to pave; to unfold; to make (a bed); store / shop / berth (read pù)
  es: extender; desplegar; tender (la cama); pavimentar; tienda / litera (leído pù)

senses[3]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to spread out, unfold, or smooth bedding, rugs, or tablecloths | extender; desplegar; tender la cama o manteles | 铺床 (make the bed / spread sheets)
  2 | Verb | Standard | to lay down or pave a road, floor, or pipeline | pavimentar; tender baldosas, raíles o tuberías | 铺路 (pave a road)
  3 | Noun | Standard | (read pù) a shop, store, or sleeping berth / bunk | (leído pù) tienda; comercio; litera | 卧铺 (sleeping berth on train)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 母亲把刚在日头下晒得干爽蓬松的棉被小心翼翼地抱进屋，平平整整地铺在大床上。 | Mǔqīn bǎ gāng zài rìtou xià shài de gānshuǎng péngsōng de miánbèi xiǎoxīnyìyì de bào jìn wū, píngpíng-zhěngzhěng de pū zài dà chuáng shàng. | Mother carried the fluffy, dry cotton quilt freshly sunned under the daylight into the room, spreading it neat and smooth over the large bed. | Mi madre llevó a la habitación el mullido edredón bien soleado y lo extendió con mimo sobre la cama matrimonial sin una arruga.
  #2 | 为了改善山区农村群众的出行条件，交通运输局组织大型机械加班加点铺设沥青路面。 | Wèile gǎishàn shānqū nóngcūn qúnzhòng de chūxíng tiáojiàn, jiāotōng yùnshū jú zǔzhī dàxíng jīxiè jiābān-jiādiǎn pūshè lìqīng lùmiàn. | To improve travel conditions for mountain villagers, the transport bureau organized heavy machinery working overtime to pave asphalt roads. | Para mejorar los caminos de los pueblos de la sierra, transportes desplegó maquinaria pesada trabajando horas extras para pavimentar la calzada con asfalto.

