  铺满 | spread all over; carpeted with
  铺平 | smooth out; flatten
  铺盖 | bedding / bedroll
  床铺 | bed; sleeping place (read pù)

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  铺天盖地 | pū tiān gài dì | blot out the sky and cover the earth; overwhelming in scale
  节衣缩食 | jié yī suō shí | live frugally; tighten one's belt
  铺张浪费 | pū zhāng làng fèi | extravagant and wasteful; excessive luxury
  平铺直叙 | píng pū zhí xù | speak or write in a dull, straightforward narrative style

character_decomposition[1]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  铺 | pū | spread; pave; store; bed | extender; desplegar; pavimentar; tienda | 钅 | metal / gold | 钅 (metal door-knocker / hardware) | 甫 (fǔ, broad / phonetic) | 12 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound where metal 钅 originally referred to flat metal door-plates, expanding to spreading materials flat. | Spreading shiny flat metal tiles (钅) broad and wide (甫) across an open floor to pave it smoothly. | Extender planchas de metal pulido (钅) a lo largo y ancho (甫) para allanar y pavimentar el suelo con tersura. | 55 | CIBY | 鋪

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Fastening broad plates of metal (钅) or unrolling fabric wide (甫) smoothly spreads out (铺) a surface.
  composite_memory_hook_es: Extender planchas resistentes (钅) o desplegar telas a lo ancho (甫) sirve para tender (铺) la cama con esmero.
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In traditional Chinese domestic hospitality, '铺床' (making a bed with fresh quilts) is a heartfelt ritual welcoming weary travelers, signaling total familial embrace and maternal solicitude.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: When used as a verb (spread/pave), pronounced in 1st tone: 'pū' (55). When used as a noun (shop/store/berth, e.g. 店铺, 上铺), pronounced in 4th tone: 'pù' (51).

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    浦 | pǔ | riverbank; shore | Has 氵 (water) on the left instead of 钅 (metal)
    捕 | bǔ | catch; seize; arrest | Has 扌 (hand) on the left of 甫
    辅 | fǔ | assist; auxiliary | Has 车 (cart) on the left of 甫
    傅 | fù | tutor; teacher | Has 亻 (person) with 寸 on the right
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
